<title>NETHERLANDS: EU fin mins to meet 0900 GMT Monday.</title>
<headline>EU fin mins to meet 0900 GMT Monday.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Finance Minister Philippe Maystadt said on Sunday that European Union finance ministers would meet again to discuss the stability pact at 0900 GMT on Monday.</p>
<p>He told reporters following a meeting of finance ministers that he hoped agreement could be reached.</p>
</text>
